WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.180 --> 00:00:01.100
As you probably know,

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:04.300
we took a page from Major League Baseball,

00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:07.630
and we filled our audience
with cardboard cutouts.

00:00:07.630 --> 00:00:11.360
We had fans send in their
photos, we put in cutouts,

00:00:11.360 --> 00:00:14.060
and we had a packed house
the last couple of nights,

00:00:14.060 --> 00:00:15.470
maybe you've seen that.

00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:20.110
But now it's standing room only.

00:00:20.110 --> 00:00:21.738
Check it out. Look at this.

00:00:21.738 --> 00:00:23.020
[Andy] Wow.

00:00:23.020 --> 00:00:26.366
We have got I mean,
the aisles are clogged,

00:00:26.366 --> 00:00:29.050
[Andy] I know
the aisles are just jammed.

00:00:29.050 --> 00:00:32.040
I can't move, not just
because it's crowded

00:00:32.040 --> 00:00:33.115
because that guy's behind me.

00:00:33.115 --> 00:00:33.948
[Canon] Yeah
I don't want to give him

00:00:33.948 --> 00:00:36.670
an excuse to leap.

00:00:36.670 --> 00:00:37.503
Yeah, no.

00:00:37.503 --> 00:00:40.790
Strike
This is in unprecedented,

00:00:40.790 --> 00:00:45.790
I've never seen in many
years of doing this show,

00:00:45.950 --> 00:00:49.890
I've never seen this many
people in an audience.

00:00:49.890 --> 00:00:53.360
In fact, we've had some concern
from the Fire Department.

00:00:53.360 --> 00:00:54.580
It's very dangerous.

00:00:54.580 --> 00:00:58.821
Yeah, this could be a fire
code violation right now.

00:00:58.821 --> 00:01:00.240
[Andy] Right?

00:01:00.240 --> 00:01:01.757
I know that a lot of you are concerned

00:01:01.757 --> 00:01:05.017
"Conan God forbid there should
be a fire in the theater,

00:01:05.017 --> 00:01:06.390
"would you be safe?"

00:01:06.390 --> 00:01:10.150
I wanna promise you all I can
get out of here instantly,

00:01:10.150 --> 00:01:11.240
if I need to,

00:01:11.240 --> 00:01:14.330
even though there are lots
of fans in the aisles,

00:01:14.330 --> 00:01:16.060
I know how to take care of number one.

00:01:16.060 --> 00:01:17.967
Andy, do me a favor just say

00:01:17.967 --> 00:01:20.640
"Conan, I smell smoke
there could be a fire."

00:01:20.640 --> 00:01:22.859
Conan I smell smoke there could be a fire.

00:01:22.859 --> 00:01:23.692
Taj!

00:01:26.409 --> 00:01:28.492
(carton rustling)

00:01:30.936 --> 00:01:32.942
Get me to of here!(carton rustling)

00:01:32.942 --> 00:01:35.533
Get me out of here!(carton rustling)

00:01:35.533 --> 00:01:37.062
I want out!(carton rustling)

00:01:37.062 --> 00:01:39.814
Get me out!(carton rustling)

00:01:39.814 --> 00:01:42.154
Get me out of here!(carton rustling)

00:01:42.154 --> 00:01:43.071
I want out!

00:01:44.540 --> 00:01:47.134
(door bangs)

00:01:47.134 --> 00:01:48.832
(Andy laughing)

00:01:48.832 --> 00:01:51.705
Well, thanks for tuning in, folks.

00:01:51.705 --> 00:01:55.513
We'll be back tomorrow with
more of whatever this is.

00:01:57.366 --> 00:02:00.033
(Canon panting)

00:02:03.280 --> 00:02:06.460
Okay, that was a worthwhile exercise,

00:02:06.460 --> 00:02:09.840
I do hope I didn't offend any of my fans,

00:02:09.840 --> 00:02:13.357
who sent in cutouts and
just saw them crushed.

00:02:13.357 --> 00:02:14.560
On a sincere note,

00:02:14.560 --> 00:02:19.450
I do wanna say that these
cutouts are helping me.

00:02:19.450 --> 00:02:22.230
I'm very appreciative that all of you,

00:02:22.230 --> 00:02:25.270
took the time to send in
photos to give me an audience.

00:02:25.270 --> 00:02:29.863
Really, sincerely I thank all
of you, except one person.

00:02:30.910 --> 00:02:34.070
That's right, his name is Caleb,

00:02:34.070 --> 00:02:36.183
and he's from Kansas City, Missouri.

00:02:38.240 --> 00:02:39.073
Look at him.

00:02:40.810 --> 00:02:45.810
Caleb thinks he's so much better than me.

00:02:48.020 --> 00:02:50.233
Got so much attitude Caleb.

00:02:51.910 --> 00:02:54.610
Who are you to judge me Caleb.

00:02:54.610 --> 00:02:58.349
I'm out here trying day in day out,

00:02:58.349 --> 00:03:03.349
whenever I come out on this
stage, I see you, judging me.

00:03:06.160 --> 00:03:09.703
Same look my father gave
me every day of my life.

00:03:12.170 --> 00:03:13.713
Here my name is Caleb.

00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:17.803
I despise you.

00:03:20.810 --> 00:03:24.923
It's you or me Caleb, one of us has to go.

00:03:26.580 --> 00:03:29.113
There isn't room in this
theater for both of us.

00:03:31.130 --> 00:03:35.080
Technically, there is, plenty of room your

00:03:36.054 --> 00:03:39.643
too dimensional, take
up much space but still,

00:03:43.190 --> 00:03:44.623
I got my eye on you Caleb.

00:03:46.830 --> 00:03:48.724
Caleb and I are going
to lunch after the show.

00:03:48.724 --> 00:03:51.060
What are you doing that for?

00:03:51.060 --> 00:03:52.910
He's a cool guy. I like him.

00:03:52.910 --> 00:03:53.743
Oh, so suddenly you're Caleb's pal.

00:03:53.743 --> 00:03:57.400
Well, I'm not his pal,

00:03:57.400 --> 00:04:02.400
he says lots of nice stuff
about me and frankly, I like it.

00:04:02.480 --> 00:04:05.730
Okay, alright. Fine,
be friends with Caleb.

00:04:05.730 --> 00:04:06.563
I will

